# (the user's, 2026-11-23) the Set page's KNOB 3 is Store (the cues' place, off): the pieces as they are now kept as a
# stored set from the FM-1 itself, no computer. At rest it shows the set it would store into: the set loaded (still
# known: setwire.c's sxw_live, or by its name after a boot), else the first empty. The first click wakes it on that one,
# each click after it the next number, used or empty, 1 to 8 (stopping at the ends), the big ring saying what is there
# ("empty", "replaces Night Set"). Resting on it 1.2 s (Load's): the pieces saved (as GLO held), written as a set and
# checked, then STORE SET n? <name> (the computer's question: GLO yes, anything else no, 30 s; "replaces <name>" under
# it when the set is used). The set: the set loaded's pieces (1 to its last), all eight with none; its name the set
# loaded's, else "SET n"; the player's Mode, Transition, sirens and Tune. Its yes: the set loaded (no LOAD IT NOW?), the
# pieces take its name. Only while stopped: playing, a turn says STOP FIRST. The flash failing: FLASH ERROR, nothing
# stored. The stored set loads back as the pieces were, and reads as a set (setread; tests/host/storeset_file_test.sh
# reads it with tools/dub1_container.py).
listen
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# the sets the FM-1 comes with in 1 and 2 (Winter Set, five pieces with cues; 4 to 5 a.m.), none loaded
expect setmask 3
expect live 0
# --- 1. no set loaded: the first empty (3), all eight pieces, "SET 3"
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
expect view 28
said Set page, the pieces, 1 of 8, Basic: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Store, set 3, Load, 2 sets stored
expect storeset 3
shot store_rest.png
# Mode to Set (the set carries it), unsaved
spin K1 2
wait 2500
said Mode Set
expect dirty 1
# the first click: the set offered (3, empty), not moved on
spin K3 1
wait 200
expect bigring 1
expect storeset 3
said Store, set 3, empty
shot store_choose.png
# resting: saved first, then asked; not before the rest is up
wait 900
expect asking 0
projmark
wait 400
expect asking 34
setstate asking
expect dirty 0
said STORE SET 3? SET 3. GLO yes, anything else no
shot store_ask.png
# yes (GLO): STORED; the set loaded now, the pieces named after it; no LOAD IT NOW?
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
said STORE SET 3 STORED
outis STORED
shot store_out_yes.png
expect live 3
expect setmask 7
expect setlen 0
sethas 2 SET 3
expect again 0
workcheck
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
expect asking 0
expect again 0
expect view 28
expect dirty 0
setread 2 2 build/scenarios/storeknob/set3.dub1
# the page: its name on the line; Store offers set 3, the set loaded
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
said Set page, SET 3, 1 of 8, Basic, next Chamber: Mode Set, Transition LP, Store, set 3, Load, 3 sets stored
expect storeset 3
shot store_after.png
# it survives a reboot: the set loaded found by its name; stored again into it (no name change, no save after)
reboot
wait 1000
expect live 0
expect setlen 0
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
expect storeset 3
said Store, set 3, Load, 3 sets stored
# --- 2. choosing: a click a number, used or empty; the ends hold
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect storeset 3
said Store, set 3, replaces SET 3
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect storeset 2
said Store, set 2, replaces 4 to 5 a.m.
shot store_choose_used.png
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect storeset 1
said Store, set 1, replaces Winter Set
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect storeset 1
spin K3 10
wait 200
expect storeset 8
said Store, set 8, empty
spin K3 -1
wait 200
expect storeset 7
# a knob turned on and off again before the rest is up: asked only once it rests
wait 600
spin K3 1
wait 600
expect asking 0
spin K3 -1
wait 1300
expect asking 34
said STORE SET 7? SET 3. GLO yes, anything else no
# --- 3. HOME: no; set 7 still empty, nothing loaded otherwise
tap HOME
wait 100
setstate no
said STORE SET 7 NOT STORED
outis NOT STORED
shot store_out_no.png
expect view 28
expect setmask 7
expect live 0
wait 3200
expect outcome 0
# --- 4. a set loaded (Winter Set: five pieces, cues on its first), changed, stored into it: its five, its name
spin K4 1
wait 1300
expect asking 48
said LOAD SET 1? Winter Set
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
expect setlen 5
expect live 1
expect slotcues0 4
wait 3200
expect storeset 1
setread 2 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-before.dub1
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K2 5
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
expect dirty 1
said Set page, Winter Set, 1 of 5, Hoarfrost, next Black Ice: Mode Set, Transition Mix, Store, set 1, Load, 3 sets stored
spin K3 1
wait 200
said Store, set 1, replaces Winter Set
wait 1300
expect asking 34
said STORE SET 1? Winter Set, replaces Winter Set. GLO yes, anything else no
shot store_ask_replaces.png
projmark
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
said STORE SET 1 STORED
expect live 1
expect again 0
expect setlen 5
sethas 0 Winter Set
wait 3200
expect asking 0
expect again 0
expect outcome 0
setread 2 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
# it loads back as the pieces were: changed again, then loaded
tap HOME
wait 300
spin K2 -5
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
spin K4 1
wait 200
spin K4 -1
wait 1300
expect asking 48
said LOAD SET 1? Winter Set
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate yes
projsame 5
expect slotcues0 4
expect setlen 5
wait 3200
# --- 5. HOME on set 1: the set as stored (its bytes)
spin K3 1
wait 1300
expect asking 34
tap HOME
wait 100
setstate no
setbytes 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
wait 3200
# --- 6. the computer busy (a set coming in): NOT STORED, its transfer left as it is
sxreq 20 02050010FFFFFFFF 20
spin K3 1
wait 1300
expect asking 0
outis NOT STORED
said STORE SET 1 NOT STORED
shot store_out_busy.png
sxreq 24 - 24
wait 3200
# --- 7. the flash: the seal (the answer's) fails: FLASH ERROR, the set as it was
spin K3 1
wait 1300
expect asking 34
powercut 1
tap GLO
wait 600
setstate failed
outis FLASH ERROR
said STORE SET 1 FLASH ERROR
shot store_out_flash.png
reboot
wait 1000
setbytes 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# ... and the pieces' save first fails: FLASH ERROR (not stored, not saved), still unsaved, nothing asked
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
spin K1 -1
wait 2500
expect dirty 1
powercut 1
spin K3 1
wait 1300
expect asking 0
outis FLASH ERROR
said STORE SET 1 FLASH ERROR
expect dirty 1
reboot
wait 1000
setbytes 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
expect setmask 7
tap PLAY
wait 400
expect playing 0
# --- 8. 30 s unanswered: NOT DONE, the set as it was
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
spin K3 1
wait 1300
expect asking 34
wait 29000
expect asking 34
wait 1100
setstate timeout
said STORE SET 1 NOT DONE: NO ANSWER
outis NOT DONE
setbytes 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
wait 3200
# --- 9. playing: Store grey, a turn says STOP FIRST and asks nothing
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 1
tap HOME
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 600
said Store, set 1, only when stopped, Load, 3 sets stored, only when stopped
shot store_playing_rest.png
spin K3 1
wait 200
said Store, stop first: sets store only while stopped
msgis STOP FIRST
expect bigring 1
shot store_playing.png
wait 1500
expect asking 0
expect outcome 0
# the music started (MIDI) while it rests: STOP FIRST, nothing stored
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 0
spin K3 1
wait 200
midi FA
wait 1300
expect asking 0
outis STOP FIRST
said STORE SET 1 STOP FIRST
setbytes 0 build/scenarios/storeknob/winter-stored.dub1
